    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q.ME is not a video game.</strong><br>It is not designed to entertain or amuse you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a tool: a slow, imperfect, sometimes uncomfortable exploration of your way of reacting, choosing, and relating to the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by a therapist and built with RPG Maker, Q.ME is a projective test disguised as an interactive experience.<br>Through your choices and behaviors, it aims to reflect aspects of your inner world that you may not be fully aware of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version of Q.ME features 12 distinct paths and over 100 possible endings, each offering a different lens through which to observe yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q.ME is not intended for those seeking a game. It is meant for those seeking themselves.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face what lies within?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q.ME is not a video game.</strong><br>It is not designed to entertain or amuse you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a tool: a slow, imperfect, sometimes uncomfortable exploration of your way of reacting, choosing, and relating to the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by a therapist and built with RPG Maker, Q.ME is a projective test disguised as an interactive experience.<br>Through your choices and behaviors, it aims to reflect aspects of your inner world that you may not be fully aware of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version of Q.ME features 12 distinct paths and over 100 possible endings, each offering a different lens through which to observe yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q.ME is not intended for those seeking a game. It is meant for those seeking themselves.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face what lies within?</p>",
    "short_description": "A projective test disguised as a videogame.Confine yourself for 10 days, explore 12 different paths, make imperfect choices, and face over 100 endings.quarantine ME is not for those seeking entertainment \u2014 it\u2019s for those willing to confront themselves.",
